<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8446" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπί-τᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be extended farther,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				10.272
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not capable of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μᾶλλον,</span> opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάνετος, διαφορά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Intr.</u>
					20.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>in Cat.</u>
					138.5
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>
			<i>without augmentation</i> or <i>intensification,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				52
			</span></i>; <i>without stress,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετ᾽
				ἐπιτάσεως,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
				<u>in Int.</u>
				11.26
			</span></i> (misplaced).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
